    "body": "personally, i think the term is and has been well established in all sorts of contexts to mean turned off, inoperable, defused, inert, etc. i don't believe the term comes with any baggage (compare to things like the name for the \"GNU Image Manipulation Program\"). if anything, the problem is that this established term has been applied to *people*.",
